# Playwright MCP review artifacts, not part of the site.
#
# SCOPED TO THE REPO ROOT ON PURPOSE. A blanket *.png here silently
# swallowed public/favicon-32.png and public/apple-touch-icon.png, so
# the site shipped <link> tags pointing at files that were never
# committed. The link integrity gate caught it in CI and blocked the
# deploy, which is the only reason it did not go live broken.
# Review artifacts land at the repo root; real site assets live under
# public/ and must always be tracked.
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
